{
 "id": "seg3",
 "title": "存储冲突",
 "pill": 3,
 "total": 142.69,
 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "seg3-00",
   "text": "代理的存储，是一排编了号的格子，叫槽位。",
   "spoken": "代理的存储，是一排编了号的格子，叫槽位。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg3-00.mp3",
   "start": 1.6,
   "dur": 4.392,
   "speechStart": 1.698,
   "speechEnd": 5.162
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-01",
   "text": "代码不认变量名，只认格子的编号。",
   "spoken": "代码不认变量名，只认格子的编号。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg3-01.mp3",
   "start": 6.212,
   "dur": 3.768,
   "speechStart": 6.31,
   "speechEnd": 9.143
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-02",
   "text": "第一种冲突：代理自己的变量，和实现的变量，撞进同一个格子。",
   "spoken": "第一种冲突：代理自己的变量，和实现的变量，撞进同一个格子。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg3-02.mp3",
   "start": 10.2,
   "dur": 5.616,
   "speechStart": 10.298,
   "speechEnd": 14.976
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-03",
   "text": "一个朴素的代理，把实现地址放在 0 号槽位。",
   "spoken": "一个朴素的代理，把实现地址放在 0 号槽位。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg3-03.mp3",
   "start": 16.036,
   "dur": 4.68,
   "speechStart": 16.134,
   "speechEnd": 19.884
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-04",
   "text": "实现合约的第一个变量是管理员，也在 0 号槽位。",
   "spoken": "实现合约的第一个变量是管理员，也在 0 号槽位。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg3-04.mp3",
   "start": 20.936,
   "dur": 4.944,
   "speechStart": 21.034,
   "speechEnd": 25.046
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-05",
   "text": "于是，写管理员，就是改写实现地址。",
   "spoken": "于是，写管理员，就是改写实现地址。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg3-05.mp3",
   "start": 26.1,
   "dur": 4.488,
   "speechStart": 26.198,
   "speechEnd": 29.745
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-06",
   "text": "修复是 EIP-1967。它用一个哈希算出的固定槽位，存放实现地址和管理员地址。",
   "spoken": "修复是 EIP-1967。它用一个哈希算出的固定槽位，存放实现地址和管理员地址。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg3-06.mp3",
   "start": 30.808,
   "dur": 8.664,
   "speechStart": 30.906,
   "speechEnd": 38.617
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-07",
   "text": "这个位置远离普通变量。算法里还减去 1，让映射和数组的派生位置，碰不到它。",
   "spoken": "这个位置远离普通变量。算法里还减去 1，让映射和数组的派生位置，碰不到它。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg3-07.mp3",
   "start": 39.692,
   "dur": 7.92,
   "speechStart": 39.79,
   "speechEnd": 46.775
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-08",
   "text": "第二种冲突：升级前后，变量的顺序变了。",
   "spoken": "第二种冲突：升级前后，变量的顺序变了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg3-08.mp3",
   "start": 47.832,
   "dur": 4.344,
   "speechStart": 47.93,
   "speechEnd": 51.334
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-09",
   "text": "先猜一道题。",
   "spoken": "先猜一道题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg3-09.mp3",
   "start": 52.396,
   "dur": 2.088,
   "speechStart": 52.494,
   "speechEnd": 53.648
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-10",
   "text": "旧版本里，0 号槽位是管理员，1 号是存款总额。",
   "spoken": "旧版本里，0 号槽位是管理员，1 号是存款总额。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg3-10.mp3",
   "start": 54.704,
   "dur": 5.232,
   "speechStart": 54.802,
   "speechEnd": 59.087
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-11",
   "text": "新版本在最前面，插入了一个手续费变量。升级以后读管理员，读到的是什么？",
   "spoken": "新版本在最前面，插入了一个手续费变量。升级以后读管理员，读到的是什么？",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg3-11.mp3",
   "start": 60.156,
   "dur": 7.176,
   "speechStart": 60.254,
   "speechEnd": 66.513
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-12",
   "text": "读到的是旧的存款总额，截掉一部分，被解释成一个地址。",
   "spoken": "读到的是旧的存款总额，截掉一部分，被解释成一个地址。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg3-12.mp3",
   "start": 67.832,
   "dur": 5.376,
   "speechStart": 67.93,
   "speechEnd": 72.358
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-13",
   "text": "因为新代码把管理员挪到了 1 号，而 1 号里还是旧数据。",
   "spoken": "因为新代码把管理员挪到了 1 号，而 1 号里还是旧数据。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg3-13.mp3",
   "start": 73.428,
   "dur": 5.52,
   "speechStart": 73.526,
   "speechEnd": 78.109
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-14",
   "text": "后面每一格都错开一位。映射的基址变了，所有余额看上去都消失了。",
   "spoken": "后面每一格都错开一位。映射的基址变了，所有余额看上去都消失了。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg3-14.mp3",
   "start": 79.168,
   "dur": 6.744,
   "speechStart": 79.266,
   "speechEnd": 85.073
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-15",
   "text": "规则有四条。",
   "spoken": "规则有四条。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg3-15.mp3",
   "start": 86.132,
   "dur": 2.064,
   "speechStart": 86.23,
   "speechEnd": 87.372
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-16",
   "text": "只在末尾追加变量。",
   "spoken": "只在末尾追加变量。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg3-16.mp3",
   "start": 88.416,
   "dur": 2.304,
   "speechStart": 88.514,
   "speechEnd": 89.883
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-17",
   "text": "不删除，不重新排序，不改类型。",
   "spoken": "不删除，不重新排序，不改类型。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg3-17.mp3",
   "start": 90.94,
   "dur": 3.864,
   "speechStart": 91.038,
   "speechEnd": 93.954
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-18",
   "text": "父合约预留一段空槽位，或者用 ERC-7201 的命名空间存储。",
   "spoken": "父合约预留一段空槽位，或者用 ERC-7201 的命名空间存储。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg3-18.mp3",
   "start": 95.024,
   "dur": 5.664,
   "speechStart": 95.122,
   "speechEnd": 99.848
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-19",
   "text": "用工具比对新旧布局，比如 OpenZeppelin 的升级插件，或者 forge inspect。不要靠肉眼核对。",
   "spoken": "用工具比对新旧布局，比如 OpenZeppelin 的升级插件，或者 forge inspect。不要靠肉眼核对。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg3-19.mp3",
   "start": 100.908,
   "dur": 8.472,
   "speechStart": 101.006,
   "speechEnd": 108.527
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-20",
   "text": "还有一种撞车，不在存储里，而在函数选择器上。",
   "spoken": "还有一种撞车，不在存储里，而在函数选择器上。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg3-20.mp3",
   "start": 109.6,
   "dur": 4.68,
   "speechStart": 109.698,
   "speechEnd": 113.471
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-21",
   "text": "选择器是函数签名哈希的前 4 个字节。两个名字完全不同的函数，可能算出同一个选择器。",
   "spoken": "选择器是函数签名哈希的前 4 个字节。两个名字完全不同的函数，可能算出同一个选择器。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg3-21.mp3",
   "start": 114.5,
   "dur": 7.944,
   "speechStart": 114.598,
   "speechEnd": 121.595
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-22",
   "text": "代理自己有这个函数时，调用会被代理截下，不会转给实现。",
   "spoken": "代理自己有这个函数时，掉用会被代理截下，不会转给实现。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg3-22.mp3",
   "start": 122.664,
   "dur": 5.04,
   "speechStart": 122.762,
   "speechEnd": 126.869
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-23",
   "text": "编译器只检查同一个合约内部的冲突。代理和实现之间，要在部署前用工具比对。",
   "spoken": "编译器只检查同一个合约内部的冲突。代理和实现之间，要在部署前用工具比对。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg3-23.mp3",
   "start": 127.924,
   "dur": 7.632,
   "speechStart": 128.022,
   "speechEnd": 134.734
  },
  {
   "id": "seg3-24",
   "text": "透明代理靠管理员不转发、其他人只转发，绕开了这个问题。",
   "spoken": "透明代理靠管理员不转发、其他人只转发，绕开了这个问题。",
   "src": "/Users/k/Workon/Learning/web3/web3-security-101/Web3-Security/video/skeuo/ep10/audio/lines/seg3-24.mp3",
   "start": 135.776,
   "dur": 5.712,
   "speechStart": 135.874,
   "speechEnd": 140.647
  }
